'''Charles Williams''' (born September 14, 1953) is a former [[Canadian football]] [[defensive back]] in the [[Canadian Football League]] who played for the [[Winnipeg Blue Bombers]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.justsportsstats.com/footballstatsindex.php?player_id=willicha001|title=Charles Williams Statistics on StatsCrew.com|website=www.StatsCrew.com}}</ref> He played [[college football]] for the [[Jackson State Tigers football|Jackson State Tigers]]. He also played in the [[National Football League]] for the [[Philadelphia Eagles]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/W/WillCh21.htm|title=Charles Williams Stats|website=Pro-Football-Reference.com}}</ref>
